You make a low blow against a sensitive point on the target, dealing [176%, 187%, 196%, 203%, 210% (TL1-5)] unarmed damage. If your attack hits, the target is left reeling and vulnerable, reducing their physical save by [5, 11, 16, 21, 25 (TL1-5)] and their stun, blind, confusion and pin immunities to 50% of normal for 4 turns.

This effect bypasses saves.
